WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:32.760
The falling stars you wished upon

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.000
are cinders now and now they're gone.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:40.440
Their residue festoons my fetid field.

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.740
Revealing husks of lovers past,

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.640
their shells are all that ever last--

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:53.680
I've taken everything that they've concealed.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.820
Whoever told you life was fair?

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:00.400
Look around you everywhere,

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:05.880
the cruelty of Nature is displayed.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.920
Why the scorn? Why the surprise?

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.940
Everything that's born must die

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:17.420
and it isn't I who made the world that way.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:46.000
What wicked little twist of fate

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.460
placed you here upon my plate?

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:54.880
Here where no one hears your cries?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:59.080
Where was your God to steer you through?

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:02.280
Perhaps your God's forsaken you?

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.560
Otherwise, why lead you here to die?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:04:02.260
I know the way how,

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:08.140
I'll melt away now.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:13.940
I know the way.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:19.380
I'm feeling bliss now,

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:31.700
dissolved to mist, how strangely I go away.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:37.800
Now I finally know...

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:42.000
It's merely moments now,

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:49.800
moments now until your feeble flesh bends to my will--

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:57.380
and it will, so rest your weary head.

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:05.620
There'll be no pain, no pain at all,

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:11.180
as everything you are dissolves.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:17.640
Your fate resolved upon my silky threads.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.040
Your fate resolved upon my silky threads.
Now I finally now.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.200
Now I finally now.

